<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP WORLD GROUP, FIRST ROUND RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP WORLD GROUP, FIRST ROUND RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1997-02-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa opened up an unbeatable 3-0 lead after the doubles match in the Davis Cup World Group first round tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Ellis Ferreira and Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat Andrei Cherkasov and Andrei Olhovsky (Russia) 6-2 3-6 6-0 6-2</p>
</text>
